Exception for the server plugin:
The server plugin (SkaffysAPI: the "paper" and "paper-api" folders,
together with the protocol code bundled inside the plugin) may be forked,
modified and shared, including modified versions, as long as it stays
free of charge and credits Skaffy with a link to the original project.
This exception does not cover the mod.

The .sfy language:
- GUI files written in the .sfy language belong to their authors, who
  may use any license for them, share them and sell them.
- The syntax coloring package (the "editor/sfy" folder) may be modified
  and shared, including modified versions, as long as it credits Skaffy
  with a link to the original project.
- Anyone may build tools that read, check or edit .sfy files (editor
  plugins, language servers, linters, formatters, checkers), under any
  license. Tools may not run .sfy files: building a compiler or runtime
  that runs them anywhere but in this mod is not allowed. Such tools
  must be written independently; copying this mod's source code into
  them is still not allowed.

